  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Figure 4: Case study of SWE-Debate resolving SymPy issue 13974 regarding powers of TensorProduct expressions. Five localization chains are evaluated; Chain 2 correctly identifies physics/quantum/tensorproduct.py. The debate synthesizes a 4-stage modification plan: (1) update tensor_product_simp, (2) update tensor_product_simp_Mul, (3) extend _eval_expand_tensorproduct, and (4) add _eval_power to TensorProduct. The patch diff in sympy/physics/quantum/tensorproduct.py shows adding _eval_power (distributing exponent over args) and handling Pow in tensor_product_simp.",
